⚡️🇺🇸 Northrop Grumman has announced a 300,000sqft (27,870.91m²) expansion to their 2,000,000sqft (185,806 m²) facility in Melbourne, Florida. The new expansion will house 17 new laboratories and an additional 1,500 personnel to the existing 5,000-personnel complex. NG has also acclaimed the expansion is necessary to further aid & support the growth of Sixth Generation Fightercrafts for the future.

